###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create product (seller)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Айфон",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 150000,
  "stock": 10
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 140000,
  "status": "hidden"
}

###

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

