{
  "name": "Тестовый товар",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 50000,
  "stock": 10
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
"login": "sevara",
"password": "password123"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"items":[
{
"product_id":2,
"quantity":1
}
]
}

### Seller смотрит свои заказы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### Pay order
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/2/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### Seller получает детали заказа
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


###

### Seller отправляет заказ (ship)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tracking": "UZ123456789"
}


###

### Проверка: заказ должен быть shipped
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}

### Повторная отправка уже shipped заказа — ждём 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### ==================== B-04 Seller управление заказами ====================


### 1. Login seller (получаем свежий seller token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "seller1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("seller_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### 2. Проверяем, что seller имеет доступ
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/test
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 3. Seller смотрит свои заказы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 4. Получить детали заказа
### если твой заказ другой, поменяй ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 5. Login user (чтобы оплатить заказ)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "sevara",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("user_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### 6. User оплачивает заказ
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/{{order_id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### 7. Проверяем, что заказ стал paid
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 8. Снова Login seller (обновляем токен)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "seller1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("seller_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### 9. Seller отправляет заказ (ship)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tracking": "UZ123456789"
}


### 10. Проверяем, что заказ стал shipped
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 11. Повторная отправка shipped заказа (должно быть 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/{{order_id}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tracking": "UZ999999999"
}


### 12. Проверяем seller не может видеть чужие заказы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/orders/999999
### ==================== B-03: Статистика продаж ====================

### Seller статистика продаж
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}

### ==================== A-05: проверка поиска/пагинации ====================

### Каталог: все параметры разом
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?q=Наушники&category=electronics&price_min=100000&price_max=1000000&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### Каталог: только пагинация, без фильтров — проверяем метаданные total/page/limit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=1&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### Каталог: page=2 — должна прийти вторая страница (или пустая, если товаров < limit*2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=2&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### Мои заказы: статус + пагинация разом
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?status=new&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}

### Мои заказы: несуществующий статус — просто пустой список, не ошибка
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?status=не_такой_статус
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### ==================== B-05: Seller управление товарами (photo + stock) ====================


### 1. Login seller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "seller1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("seller_access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}


### 2. Проверяем seller доступ
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/test
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 3. Создаем новый товар для проверки
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Айфон",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 800000,
  "stock": 20
}

> {%
    client.global.set("seller_product_id", response.body.id);
%}


### 4. Seller смотрит свои товары
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 5. Обновляем цену и stock товара
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 750000,
  "stock": 15
}


### 6. Проверяем обновленный товар
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### 7. Загружаем фото товара
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{seller_product_id}}/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

photo=@/Users/nozee/Downloads/test-image.jpeg


### 8. Проверяем товар после добавления фото
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}


### 9. Проверка невалидного обновления цены
### ожидаем 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 0
}


### 10. Проверка невалидного stock
### ожидаем 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": -5
}


### 11. Удаление товара (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 12. Seller видит скрытый товар
### должен вернуть товар со статусом hidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/manage/products
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_access_token}}


### 13. User больше не видит скрытый товар
### должен вернуть 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/{{seller_product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_access_token}}